{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019A8RSq9gTTXRJNPXRM4g8Z","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t// mcp.go implements manigot's MCP (Model Context Protocol) server delivery\n2\t// mechanism: a global+project directory pair (<home>/mcp/, docs/mcp/)\n3\t// mirroring how agents/ + docs/agents/ and skills/ + docs/skills/ are\n4\t// discovered and merged (see agentconv.go/skillconv.go), a canonical\n5\t// CLI-agnostic per-server schema, $VARNAME secret resolution against\n6\t// manigot's own .env, and conversion into each CLI's native config shape\n7\t// (Claude Code's .mcp.json, OpenCode's opencode.json `mcp` block).\n8\tpackage session\n9\t\n10\timport (\n11\t\t\"encoding/json\"\n12\t\t\"fmt\"\n13\t\t\"os\"\n14\t\t\"path/filepath\"\n15\t\t\"regexp\"\n16\t\t\"strings\"\n17\t\n18\t\t\"github.com/lmuskalla/manigot/internal/config\"\n19\t)\n20\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ff35466-1740-4190-9c53-6ab704f13a39","uuid":"6b7c5c2e-6dc1-4f90-8b0d-5e443d595715","timestamp":"2026-08-31T13:59:52.053Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/src/internal/session/mcp.go","content":"// mcp.go implements manigot's MCP (Model Context Protocol) server delivery\n// mechanism: a global+project directory pair (<home>/mcp/, docs/mcp/)\n// mirroring how agents/ + docs/agents/ and skills/ + docs/skills/ are\n// discovered and merged (see agentconv.go/skillconv.go), a canonical\n// CLI-agnostic per-server schema, $VARNAME secret resolution against\n// manigot's own .env, and conversion into each CLI's native config shape\n// (Claude Code's .mcp.json, OpenCode's opencode.json `mcp` block).\npackage session\n\nimport (\n\t\"encoding/json\"\n\t\"fmt\"\n\t\"os\"\n\t\"path/filepath\"\n\t\"regexp\"\n\t\"strings\"\n\n\t\"github.com/lmuskalla/manigot/internal/config\"\n)\n","numLines":20,"startLine":1,"totalLines":295}}}
